Perplexity Portable Computer expands local-agent deployment toward Windows
RTX

NVIDIA describes Portable Computer as a packaged local agent stack where
models, harness, tools and workflows can execute locally, with explicit
permission before escalating work to cloud models. The broader NVIDIA
local-agent stack is also converging around one-click local setup for
Hermes/OpenClaw/Perplexity, llama.cpp/vLLM optimizations and local
inference routing.

Primary NVIDIA source:
https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/local-ai-ifa-next-gen-agents-nv-pair-rtx-spar=
k/

*Why it matters to Privately:* private agent is becoming less synonymous
with build your own obscure stack. Major agent products are starting to
package local orchestration + tools + sandbox + open models as a normal
deployment mode. The differentiation therefore moves upward toward policy,
authority, auditability and safe hybrid escalation.

*Decision:* WATCH / CONTENT NOW if framed as local inference is becoming
commodity; private authority is not.
