3. AGENT FRAMEWORK / OSS FRONTIER

NEW =E2=80=94 Paper2Agent
<p><strong>What is new:</strong> automated conversion of scientific papers =
into AI agents. Published in Nature on Sep 17, 2026.</p>
<p><strong>Technical delta:</strong> instead of an agent merely retrieving/=
summarizing a paper, the research artifact is transformed into an interacti=
ve agent that exposes the paper=E2=80=99s methods/data/code as usable capab=
ility. The publication also describes paper-agents interacting to support d=
iscovery.</p>
<p><strong>Why serious builders may use it:</strong> scientific tooling has=
