ting it. Packaging the method as an agent attacks that integration bottlene=
ck directly.</p>
<p><strong>Route:</strong> Nature paper: <a href=3D"https://www.nature.com/=
articles/s41586-026-11044-y">https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-110=
44-y</a> . Code/reproduction status should be rechecked next run rather tha=
n inferred from secondary snippets.</p>
<p><strong>Trajectory inference:</strong> 6m: reproductions and domain-spec=
ific paper agents; 18m: agent-callable research-method registries; 36m: pap=
ers increasingly ship executable agent interfaces; 60m: scientific literatu=
re partly behaves like a capability graph rather than a text corpus.</p>
<p><strong>Privately implication:</strong> a paper-agent is also a software=
